It appears that domestication of cattle began about 8,000 years ago in three separate locations.

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:53.060
One location is Mesopotamia, and another was in the Indus River Valley.

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:57.220
And the third location now is believed to be Africa.

