But it was the cow that became early man's most important ally

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:24.860
as the hunter-gatherer lifestyle gradually settled into agriculture.

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:36.810
What made the cow so special?

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:44.920
On the plains of East Africa, where earliest man first hunted,

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:48.130
we can still see what our ancestors were up against.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:54.100
Criteria for domestication is uncompromising.

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:57.020
Very few species would pass muster.

00:08:58.840 --> 00:08:59.980
If an animal is too...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:06.250
flighty or depends on mass migration for survival, it fails. If it cannot breed in

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:14.420
captivity, it fails. If it grows too slowly or too large, it fails. If its diet or the

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:21.200
conditions it needs are too specialized to recreate, it fails. If it is too aggressive,

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:29.980
it fails. Kao passed all these exacting tests to become the most important member of a

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:37.760
very exclusive club the domesticates our ancestors chose wisely and there have been very few additions

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:49.490
to their original list of animal allies it seems that cattle's herd behavior is what made them so

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:54.870
suitable for domestication because they like to stay in a group they seek solace in the group and

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:59.750
they stay together, and by them following their self-selected leader.

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.580
for where they choose to go.

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:04.380
It's been easy for man to take that place

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:07.920
and to become imprinted as the leader of the herd.

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:11.380
And on the other hand, animals that are quite nervous

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.660
and have a nervous temperament

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:15.220
and exhibit flight response, when man appears,

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:16.720
they just jump and run.

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:19.240
And there's no chance for interaction.

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:21.960
So it was that pause that cattle have,

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:25.600
that curiosity, the security that they have within a herd.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.380
They feel very secure when they're all together.

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:29.440
so they don't up and run and run.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.820
and so it gives that chance for man and cattle to bond.

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:42.450
In every new relationship there are new responsibilities.

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:47.820
But who exactly was in charge? Man or cow?

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:53.070
Although the cow pulled the plow, man too was set to work.

