find her own food which was always a strength and the maintaining of

00:45:59.900 --> 00:45:59.940
All right.

00:46:00.060 --> 00:46:04.480
animals in very intensive conditions under blanket antibiotic cover isn't going to work

00:46:04.480 --> 00:46:10.590
either. In fact, it's dying soon. So this extreme intensification of agriculture last 50 years

00:46:10.590 --> 00:46:14.850
is probably something of a blip in the whole evolution of man's association with animals.

00:46:21.490 --> 00:46:24.930
There is a new breed of ranchers across the United States,

00:46:25.090 --> 00:46:28.410
raising cattle in a very different way from the feedlot system.

00:46:30.990 --> 00:46:35.840
One of them is Dale Lassiter, who runs the family ranch in Matheson, Colorado.

00:46:37.060 --> 00:46:40.500
Dale brings the story of man and cattle full circle.

