On hearing of the tragedy, one Maasai tribe

00:52:16.740 --> 00:52:20.230
was moved to give cattle, the most valuable thing

00:52:20.230 --> 00:52:22.810
they own, to the people of New York.

00:52:26.780 --> 00:52:29.980
Kao carried a message of condolence from one

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:53.100
tribe to heal another. Some would argue that we did not domesticate the cow. The cow domesticated

